<p>Alongside the e-Way Bill, you will receive an <strong>IBA-approved Lorry Receipt (LR) or Bilty</strong>. Issued by the Indian Bunch of Agents, this LR serves as the official contract of carriage. It confirms that the goods have been received in good condition and specifies the delivery terms.</p>
<p>For premium services like <strong>om sai packers and movers patna</strong>, the LR is often accompanied by a detailed inventory list, minimizing disputes upon arrival. Whether you are using specialized <strong>bike packers and movers in patna</strong> for two-wheelers or full-service providers, the LR acts as your primary proof of ownership and transit responsibility.</p>

