<p>Clean furniture placement follows the testing stage. Items are positioned in their designated locations according to the site layout plan, with attention to alignment, stability, and aesthetics. Furniture is cleaned on‑site using approved cleaning agents, and protective covers are removed only after final inspection to prevent dust accumulation during the early days of use.</p>

